## 📖 About

This repository contains the **Python programs and practical exercises** I have worked on during my college coursework.

It includes everything from basic Python programming to working with libraries such as **NumPy** and **Pandas**.

I'm using this repository to keep my programs organized, practice programming, and track my progress as I learn Python.

---

## 📚 Topics

| 🧩 Topic           | 📌 Concepts                             |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------- |
| 🐍 Python Basics   | Variables, Data Types, Input & Output   |
| 🔀 Control Flow    | `if`, `elif`, `else`, Loops             |
| 📦 Data Structures | Lists, Tuples, Sets, Dictionaries       |
| 🔤 Strings         | String Operations, Slicing              |
| ⚙️ Functions       | Arguments, Return Values, Recursion     |
| 🔢 NumPy           | Arrays, Matrices, Reshaping, Operations |
| 📊 Statistics      | Mean, Median, Mode, Standard Deviation  |
| 🐼 Pandas          | Series, DataFrames, Data Manipulation   |

